{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not make MDC snapshot failures terminal workflow failures.** Mapping an ordinary `MDC.getCopyOfContextMap()` failure through `finishFailure` permanently returns durable `FAILED` before hooks or user code run. Treat capture as best-effort with a safe clearing fallback, or propagate it for invocation retry instead of serializing a terminal response.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77QAQ6","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":270,"observation_digest":"293a6464ed8e03e6f3e7a8e970584809a15332c20c1a4f0b3e93fc47ceb50f7a","observation_id":"aro_v1_fe5gizhnryb6n47hvduxawcibg","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-08T05:44:10Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ujohmip6mlep7p7lfksixhq4vk","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"00c12717417954984b3c3dea73b86b1cbb241039","reviewer":"codex","start_line":269,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_ysu4d2koj3vd34ztyulx5syz6v","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T05:44:10Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
